<P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.the-kgb.com" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">(KGB) The Knights of Glory and Beer</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #kgb<br>Since 1997, KGB has been the standard for "ANTI" Guilds in virtual worlds.  STOP IN (KGB) The Knights of Glory and Beer is involved in Anarchy Online, Asheron's Call, Shadowbane, Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><b><font color="#CCCC99">Acideath-Malicious</font></b>&nbsp;- #Acideath<br>Blood Is Thicker Then Water Acideath-Malicious is involved in Origin, Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://aov.wfsg.net" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Alliance of Virtue</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #aov<br>Guild channel for the Alliance of Virtue - Ultima Online - Baja Shard Alliance of Virtue is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><b><font color="#CCCC99">Anarchy for Eternity</font></b>&nbsp;- #afe<br>Anarchy for Eternity is a guild originally created by Exodus, and Strahd for Ultima Online (BAJA).  AfE will return in UWO:Origin under their command. Anarchy for Eternity is involved in Origin.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.liquaweb.com/elf/" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Ancient Elven Order</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #eo<br>Enigmatic and powerful, elves have dominated the fantasy landscape for years. Although their civilizations and powers have always been a mystery to those who travel in the realms of fantasy, their influence is undeniably strong. Abandoned cities, lost technology, forgotten lore...all these things and more lie within the mystique of the elves. Their land, their culture, and their philosophy remain cryptic mysteries to those not blessed with the love of elves. ElF - Pacific Shard. Member of the Organization of Pacific Roll-Players & Adventurers Ancient Elven Order is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.angelfire.com/rpg/guildAPG/index.html" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">APG</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #APG<br>We use this channel to disscuss guild events.  It is also used as a help line when guild mates need assistance APG is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://arctic_rescue.tripod.com" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Arctic Legends</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #arctic<br>A guild designed around the novel "The Arctic Rescue" Arctic Legends is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.angelfire.com/rpg/thiefarmy" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Army Of Thieves</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #thiefarmy<br>Army of Thieves Cheseapeake
Recruiting! If you want to join, go to our irc channel and ask any of the ops to add you to the guild! Army Of Thieves is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.atani.com" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Atani</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #atani<br>The ways of the Atani build on the diversity of its members. Each individual's strength will always be recognized and through unity, we shall venture forth. The quest is to always learn of who we are and how our lives intertwine to become legendary stories that will be passed on through the generations. We should never consider ourselves elite because of our affiliations. To do so would be to spit on the many diamonds in the rough. To provide a helping hand to all members of our alliance as well as others in distress. We befriend all those who seek a helping hand. To learn the history of Norrath and to quest together to create a legendary epic for future generations... We are Atani. Atani is involved in Everquest, Origin.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><b><font color="#CCCC99">Augen der Götter</font></b>&nbsp;- #adg<br>A DF Guild Augen der Götter is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.aussiegamers.org/" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Australia's Official Channel</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #Australia<br>This channel is for all the Australian Gamers out there that would like to chat with all the other Aussies, to hang out, and have fun... Australia's Official Channel is involved in Adellion, Anarchy Online, Asheron's Call, Atriarch, Camelot, Dawn, Everquest, Hero's Journey, Jumpgate, Middle Earth, Neocron, Neverwinter Nights, Origin, Shadowbane, Sovereign, Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://battlecry.altgames.net" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Battle Cry</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #battlecry<br>Battle Cry is a Neutral Guild. We hold no prejudice to Good or Evil. If you like to have fun, make friends, roleplay and help others have a good time on Everquest we are the Guild you are looking for. Battle Cry is involved in Everquest.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://blcircle.00it.com" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Black Circle</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #blackcircle<br>A thieves' guild that consists of assassins, thieves, bandits, highwaymen, merchants, and other sneaky people.  Main objective of the guild is to make a profit. Black Circle is involved in Dawn.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.bls.de.vu" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Black Lotus Society</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #BLS<br>BLS internal Black Lotus Society is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.bloodrock.uoguilds.com/" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Bloodrock Clan</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #Bloodrock<br>The Bloodrock Clan is a group of roleplayers portraying Orcs in Ultima Online.  Mainly stationed on Great Lakes, however are expanding to all UO shards. Bloodrock Clan is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.crosswinds.net/~uocpl/guild/guild.html" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Catskills Preservers of Life</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #CPL<br>A channel for the gathering of CPL members and those interested in the guild.  We also welcome anyone interested in healing tips and/or advice! Catskills Preservers of Life is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><b><font color="#CCCC99">Celtic Clan of the Kindred</font></b>&nbsp;- #CCK<br>Our meeting room away from game. Celtic Clan of the Kindred is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.championsofvirtue.org" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Champions of Virtue</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #cov<br>The Champions of Virtue is a UWO:Origin gaming guild of good alignment for roleplayers following the eight virtues of Lord British as their guiding principles. Champions of Virtue is involved in Origin, Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><b><font color="#CCCC99">Clan of Virtue</font></b>&nbsp;- #clan-virtue<br>Private... by invitation only. Clan of Virtue is involved in Ultima Online.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.collectorsofsouls.net/" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Collector of Souls</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #collectorofsouls<br>Guild on Mithaniel Marr. Collector of Souls is involved in Everquest.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
      <p><TABLE WIDTH=100% CELLPADDING=1 CELLSPACING=0 BORDER=0 ALIGN="CENTER"><P><a href="http://www.collectorsofsouls.net" target=_blank><b><font color="#CCCC99">Collectors of Souls</font></b></a>&nbsp;- #collectorsofsouls<br>A place that let all collected souls hang around when not on EQ Collectors of Souls is involved in Everquest.</td></tr></TABLE><P>
